## Hand-off (now-md) — for Gemini CLI (GEMINI.md)
- Read `NOW.md` first in every session. It is written by a script; never edit it by hand.
- At each milestone run one of (use `--who gemini`):
  - `python3 nowmd.py add --who gemini --title "<task>"`
  - `python3 nowmd.py update --id <id> --status blocked --why "<reason>" --fix "<how to unblock>"`
  - `python3 nowmd.py done --id <id> --result <result-file>`
  - `python3 nowmd.py note "<decision>"`
